mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\npodcast-and-audiograms is the **audio→social pipeline** — clip the best moments (retention-led), brand +\ncaption them, CTA back to the full episode. The agent **plans + briefs + writes hooks/CTAs + plans the\ncadence**; a **clip/audiogram tool** produces the clips; **WoopSocial publishes the finished clips/audiograms\non a schedule**; the **full episode lives on the podcast host.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** plans the **clip strategy** (retention-based selection), **briefs the clip/audiogram\n  creation** (format, specs, captions, branding), **writes hooks + strategic CTAs**, and **plans the\n  cross-platform cadence.**\n- **A clip tool** (Opus Clip/Choppity/Descript/Kapwing) or **audiogram tool** (Headliner/Podsqueeze) produces\n  the clips; **the creator finalizes** them.\n- **WoopSocial publishes the finished clips/audiograms on a schedule.** It does **NOT** record/edit/transcribe\n  the podcast, **generate clips/audiograms**, **host the podcast** (Spotify/Apple/RSS), or pull **retention\n  analytics.**\n- **Captions are non-optional** (85% sound-off); **strategic CTA** back to the full episode; **the full\n  episode lives on the podcast host**; **never fabricate virality**; **never clip someone else's copyrighted\n  podcast** for a brand (clip your own / get permission). **Verify-quarterly** (tools/pricing).\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **podcast-and-audiograms (this)** — the **audio→social pipeline** (retention-led selection + the **audiogram**\n  format + the **CTA-back-to-episode**).\n- **captions-and-clipping** — the **general** video-clipping + **caption burn-in** craft/tools (`clipping.md`).\n  A **video-podcast clip's burn-in routes there**; this owns the **audio-first strategy + audiograms.**\n- **content-recycling / cross-platform-repurposing** — the **general reuse axes** (the episode is one rich\n  **source**).\n- **youtube-long-form / youtube-publishing-and-metadata** — the **full episode** as a YouTube long-form upload\n  (this is the **clip/audiogram** repurposing).\n- **ai-voiceover** — generating a **synthetic voice** (this repurposes a **real recorded** conversation).\n- **ai-music-and-sound** — the **music bed/SFX** (this is the **spoken-word** content).\n- **carousel-writer** / **email-and-newsletter** — the **quote-card/carousel** + the **episode→newsletter**\n  routes.\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (voice/branding), the **episode** (recording + transcript + retention data).\n- **Pulls from:** the **podcast host** (Spotify/Apple/RSS — the full episode + retention), the **clip/audiogram\n  tools**; **captions-and-clipping**/`clipping.md` (video-clip burn-in), **design-and-templates** (audiogram\n  templates + quote cards), **carousel-writer** (a moment → carousel), **email-and-newsletter** (episode →\n  newsletter), **social-seo**/`youtube-publishing-and-metadata` (titles/keywords).\n- **Publishes via:** the **finished clips/audiograms** → `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (across platforms\n  on a cadence). **Reuse:** `content-recycling`/`cross-platform-repurposing`. **Measure with:** native +\n  `analytics-and-reporting` (never fabricated). **The full episode stays on the podcast host.**\n"
